st-meta-item eventlist-meta-time event-meta-item\">\n              <span class=\"event-time-12hr\">\n                <time class=\"event-time-12hr-start\" datetime=\"2025-12-11\">7:00 pm</time>\n                <span class=\"event-datetime-divider\"></span>\n                <time class=\"event-time-12hr-end\" datetime=\"2025-12-11\">10:30 pm</time>\n              </span>\n              <span class=\"event-time-24hr\">\n                <time class=\"event-time-24hr-start\" datetime=\"2025-12-11\">19:00</time>\n                <span class=\"event-datetime-divider\"></span>\n                <time class=\"event-time-12hr-end\" datetime=\"2025-12-11\">22:30</time>\n              </span>\n            </li>\n\n            \n\n            \n              \n            \n\n            <li class=\"eventlist-meta-item eventlist-meta-export event-meta-item\">\n              <a href=\"http://www.google.com/calendar/event?action=TEMPLATE&text=The%20Double%20Act%20Presents%3A%20A%20Concrete%20Atlantis%20Hauntological%20Holiday%20Happening&dates=20251211T190000Z/20251211T223000Z\" class=\"eventlist-meta-export-google\">Google Calendar</a>\n              <span class=\"eventlist-meta-export-divider\"></span>\n              <a href=\"/events/a-concrete-atlantis-hauntological-holiday-happening?format=ical\" class=\"eventlist-meta-export-ical\">ICS</a>\n            </li>\n\n          </ul>\n\n          \n          <div class=\"eventlist-excerpt\"><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">A seasonal evening of barely-remembered formats and sonic seances featuring glimmers of the ghostly televisual past, psychogeographical spoken word, music and moving pictures.&nbsp;</p></div>\n          \n\n          <a href=\"/events/a-concrete-atlantis-hauntological-holiday-happening\" class=\"eventlist-button sqs-editable-button sqs-button-element--primary\">\n            View Event &#8594;\n          </a>\n\n          <div class=\"eventlist-actions\">\n  <span class=\"sqs-simple-like\" data-item-id=\"68dd2e0a40fa3e1be8749441\" data-like-count=\"0\">\n    <span class=\"like-icon\"></span>\n    <span class=\"like-count\"></span>\n  </span>\n<span class=\"squarespace-social-buttons inline-style\" data-system-data-id=\"1759325788272-A2D9PJG9916YB40EG2N0\" data-asset-url=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5a65df9e2aeba5d8b0fd547c/1759325788272-A2D9PJG9916YB40EG2N0/1000072759.png\" data-record-type=\"12\" data-full-url=\"/events/a-concrete-atlantis-hauntological-holiday-happening\" data-title=\"The Double Act Presents: A Concrete Atlantis Hauntological Holiday Happening\"></span></div>\n\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"clear\"></div>\n\n      </article>\n\n    \n\n      <article class=\"eventlist-event eventlist-event--past eventlist-event--hasimg eventlist-hasimg\">\n\n        <a href=\"/events/miskatonic-the-asylum\" class=\"eventlist-column-thumbnail content-fill\"><img data-src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5a65df9e2aeba5d8b0fd547c/1764784870209-06TF4J88YI9SFE1IAVV0/London-4-Banners2-scaled.jpg\" data-image=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5a65df9e2aeba5d8b0fd547c/1764784870209-06TF4J88YI9SFE1IAVV0/London-4-Banners2-scaled.jpg\" data-image-dimensions=\"2560x1440\" data-image-focal-point=\"0.5,0.5\" alt=\"&quot;And where do you live, Simon&quot;? The Asylum and its Patients on Film\"  class=\"eventlist-thumbnail\" data-load=\"false\"></a>\n\n        <a href=\"/events/miskatonic-the-asylum\" class=\"eventlist-column-date\">\n\n          <div class=\"eventlist-datetag\">\n\n            <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-inner\">\n\n              <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-startdate eventlist-datetag-startdate--month\">Dec</div>\n              <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-startdate eventlist-datetag-startdate--day\">9</div>\n\n              \n              <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-time\"><span class=\"event-time-12hr\">7:00 pm</span><span class=\"event-time-24hr\">19:00</span></div>\n\n              \n\n              <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-status\"></div>\n\n            </div>\n\n          </div>\n\n        </a>\n\n        <div class=\"eventlist-column-info\">\n\n          \n          <div class=\"eventlist-cats\">\n            <a href=\"?category=Upcoming\">Upcoming</a>, <a href=\"?category=Film\">Film</a>, <a href=\"?category=Talk\">Talk</a>\n          </div>\n          \n\n          <h1 class=\"eventlist-title\"><a href=\"/events/miskatonic-the-asylum\" class=\"eventlist-title-link\">\"And where do you live, Simon\"? The Asylum and its Patients on Film</a></h1>\n\n          <ul class=\"eventlist-meta event-meta\">\n\n            \n\n            <li class=\"eventlist-meta-item eventlist-meta-date event-meta-item\">\n              <time class=\"event-date\" datetime=\"2025-12-09\">Tuesday 9 December 2025</time>\n            </li>\n\n            <li class=\"eventlist-meta-item eventlist-meta-time event-meta-item\">\n              <span class=\"event-time-12hr\">\n                <time class=\"event-time-12hr-start\" datetime=\"2025-12-09\">7:00 pm</time>\n                <span class=\"event-datetime-divider\"></span>\n                <time class=\"event-time-12hr-end\" datetime=\"2025-12-09\">10:30 pm</time>\n              </span>\n              <span class=\"event-time-24hr\">\n                <time class=\"event-time-24hr-start\" datetime=\"2025-12-09\">19:00</time>\n                <span class=\"event-datetime-divider\"></span>\n                <time class=\"event-time-12hr-end\" datetime=\"2025-12-09\">22:30</time>\n              </span>\n            </li>\n\n            \n\n            \n              \n            \n\n            <li class=\"eventlist-meta-item eventlist-meta-export event-meta-item\">\n              <a href=\"http://www.google.com/calendar/event?action=TEMPLATE&text=%22And%20where%20do%20you%20live%2C%20Simon%22%3F%20The%20Asylum%20and%20its%20Patients%20on%20Film&dates=20251209T190000Z/20251209T223000Z\" class=\"eventlist-meta-export-google\">Google Calendar</a>\n              <span class=\"eventlist-meta-export-divider\"></span>\n              <a href=\"/events/miskatonic-the-asylum?format=ical\" class=\"eventlist-meta-export-ical\">ICS</a>\n            </li>\n\n          </ul>\n\n          \n          <div class=\"eventlist-excerpt\"><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Presented by <strong>Mikatonic</strong>, this talk explores how cinematic representations of the asylum and its patients have reflected real-life developments in psychiatry, including the demolition of Victorian institutions and moves toward community-based care in the late 20th century. We will also see how film itself played a role in these developments, with documentary exposés of asylum life like Frederick Wiseman's <em>Titicut Follies </em>(1967) revealing the real-life horrors of the institution.</p></div>\n          \n\n          <a href=\"/events/miskatonic-the-asylum\" class=\"eventlist-button sqs-editable-button sqs-button-element--primary\">\n            View Event &#8594;\n          </a>\n\n          <div class=\"eventlist-actions\">\n  <span class=\"sqs-simple-like\" data-item-id=\"68cd4391954bdf43ff845350\" data-like-count=\"0\">\n    <span class=\"like-icon\"></span>\n    <span class=\"like-count\"></span>\n  </span>\n<span class=\"squarespace-social-buttons inline-style\" data-system-data-id=\"1764784870209-06TF4J88YI9SFE1IAVV0\" data-asset-url=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5a65df9e2aeba5d8b0fd547c/1764784870209-06TF4J88YI9SFE1IAVV0/London-4-Banners2-scaled.jpg\" data-record-type=\"12\" data-full-url=\"/events/miskatonic-the-asylum\" data-title=\"&quot;And where do you live, Simon&quot;? The Asylum and its Patients on Film\"></span></div>\n\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"clear\"></div>\n\n      </article>\n\n    \n\n      <article class=\"eventlist-event eventlist-event--past eventlist-event--hasimg eventlist-hasimg\">\n\n        <a href=\"/events/nsf2025-2-gt8hc\" class=\"eventlist-column-thumbnail content-fill\"><img data-src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5a65df9e2aeba5d8b0fd547c/1763222881090-N1M1S74RNKBNT5L4N8IX/USE+THIS+PLEASE%21+FIRST_HORSE_1.1.17_girl+and+horse2.jpeg\" data-image=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5a65df9e2aeba5d8b0fd547c/1763222881090-N1M1S74RNKBNT5L4N8IX/USE+THIS+PLEASE%21+FIRST_HORSE_1.1.17_girl+and+horse2.jpeg\" data-image-dimensions=\"3996x1528\" data-image-focal-point=\"0.5,0.5\" alt=\"Native Spirit Festival 2025: Sunday Shorts | Dusk Programme\"  class=\"eventlist-thumbnail\" data-load=\"false\"></a>\n\n        <a href=\"/events/nsf2025-2-gt8hc\" class=\"eventlist-column-date\">\n\n          <div class=\"eventlist-datetag\">\n\n            <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-inner\">\n\n              <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-startdate eventlist-datetag-startdate--month\">Nov</div>\n              <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-startdate eventlist-datetag-startdate--day\">23</div>\n\n              \n              <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-time\"><span class=\"event-time-12hr\">4:45 pm</span><span class=\"event-time-24hr\">16:45</span></div>\n\n              \n\n              <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-status\"></div>\n\n            </div>\n\n          </div>\n\n        </a>\n\n        <div class=\"eventlist-column-info\">\n\n          \n          <div class=\"eventlist-cats\">\n            <a href=\"?category=Upcoming\">Upcoming</a>, <a href=\"?category=Film\">Film</a>, <a href=\"?category=Native+Spirit+Festival\">Native Spirit Festival</a>\n          </div>\n          \n\n          <h1 class=\"eventlist-title\"><a href=\"/events/nsf2025-2-gt8hc\" class=\"eventlist-title-link\">Native Spirit Festival 2025: Sunday Shorts | Dusk Programme</a></h1>\n\n          <ul class=\"eventlist-meta event-meta\">\n\n            \n\n            <li class=\"eventlist-meta-item eventlist-meta-date event-meta-item\">\n              <time class=\"event-date\" datetime=\"2025-11-23\">Sunday 23 November 2025</time>\n            </li>\n\n            <li class=\"eventlist-meta-item eventlist-meta-time event-meta-item\">\n              <span class=\"event-time-12hr\">\n                <time class=\"event-time-12hr-start\" datetime=\"2025-11-23\">4:45 pm</time>\n                <span class=\"event-datetime-divider\"></span>\n                <time class=\"event-time-12hr-end\" datetime=\"2025-11-23\">7:00 pm</time>\n              </span>\n              <span class=\"event-time-24hr\">\n                <time class=\"event-time-24hr-start\" datetime=\"2025-11-23\">16:45</time>\n                <span class=\"event-datetime-divider\"></span>\n                <time class=\"event-time-12hr-end\" datetime=\"2025-11-23\">19:00</time>\n              </span>\n            </li>\n\n            \n\n            \n              \n            \n\n            <li class=\"eventlist-meta-item eventlist-meta-export event-meta-item\">\n              <a href=\"http://www.google.com/calendar/event?action=TEMPLATE&text=Native%20Spirit%20Festival%202025%3A%20Sunday%20Shorts%20%7C%20Dusk%20Programme&dates=20251123T164500Z/20251123T190000Z\" class=\"eventlist-meta-export-google\">Google Calendar</a>\n              <span class=\"eventlist-meta-export-divider\"></span>\n              <a href=\"/events/nsf2025-2-gt8hc?format=ical\" class=\"eventlist-meta-export-ical\">ICS</a>\n            </li>\n\n          </ul>\n\n          \n          <div class=\"eventlist-excerpt\"><p class=\"sqsrte-small\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">The UK’s first and longest-running festival of Indigenous Cinema returns to the Horse Hospital with a dusk programme of short films by First Nations filmmakers <strong>Suni Sonqo Vizcarra Wood, Rodrigo Sena, Pranami Koch, Payam Shadnia, Arina Mado,</strong> and <strong>Awanui Simich-Pene.</strong></p></div>\n          \n\n          <a href=\"/events/nsf2025-2-gt8hc\" class=\"eventlist-button sqs-editable-button sqs-button-element--primary\">\n            View Event &#8594;\n          </a>\n\n          <div class=\"eventlist-actions\">\n  <span class=\"sqs-simple-like\" data-item-id=\"6917279b410c9f6f3154a8d4\" data-like-count=\"0\">\n    <span class=\"like-icon\"></span>\n    <span class=\"like-count\"></span>\n  </span>\n<span class=\"squarespace-social-buttons inline-style\" data-system-data-id=\"1763222881090-N1M1S74RNKBNT5L4N8IX\" data-asset-url=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5a65df9e2aeba5d8b0fd547c/1763222881090-N1M1S74RNKBNT5L4N8IX/USE+THIS+PLEASE%21+FIRST_HORSE_1.1.17_girl+and+horse2.jpeg\" data-record-type=\"12\" data-full-url=\"/events/nsf2025-2-gt8hc\" data-title=\"Native Spirit Festival 2025: Sunday Shorts | Dusk Programme\"></span></div>\n\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"clear\"></div>\n\n      </article>\n\n    \n\n      <article class=\"eventlist-event eventlist-event--past eventlist-event--hasimg eventlist-hasimg\">\n\n        <a href=\"/events/nsf2025-1\" class=\"eventlist-column-thumbnail content-fill\"><img data-src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5a65df9e2aeba5d8b0fd547c/1763124160887-LTX2UNYTZCRMHHDKY02F/Circles+P6.jpg\" data-image=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5a65df9e2aeba5d8b0fd547c/1763124160887-LTX2UNYTZCRMHHDKY02F/Circles+P6.jpg\" data-image-dimensions=\"1620x1080\" data-image-focal-point=\"0.5,0.5\" alt=\"Native Spirit Festival 2025: Sunday Shorts | Matinee Programme\"  class=\"eventlist-thumbnail\" data-load=\"false\"></a>\n\n        <a href=\"/events/nsf2025-1\" class=\"eventlist-column-date\">\n\n          <div class=\"eventlist-datetag\">\n\n            <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-inner\">\n\n              <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-startdate eventlist-datetag-startdate--month\">Nov</div>\n              <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-startdate eventlist-datetag-startdate--day\">23</div>\n\n              \n              <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-time\"><span class=\"event-time-12hr\">1:45 pm</span><span class=\"event-time-24hr\">13:45</span></div>\n\n              \n\n              <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-status\"></div>\n\n            </div>\n\n          </div>\n\n        </a>\n\n        <div class=\"eventlist-column-info\">\n\n          \n          <div class=\"eventlist-cats\">\n            <a href=\"?category=Upcoming\">Upcoming</a>, <a href=\"?category=Film\">Film</a>, <a href=\"?category=Native+Spirit+Festival\">Native Spirit Festival</a>\n          </div>\n          \n\n          <h1 class=\"eventlist-title\"><a href=\"/events/nsf2025-1\" class=\"eventlist-title-link\">Native Spirit Festival 2025: Sunday Shorts | Matinee Programme</a></h1>\n\n          <ul class=\"eventlist-meta event-meta\">\n\n            \n\n            <li class=\"eventlist-meta-item eventlist-meta-date event-meta-item\">\n              <time class=\"event-date\" datetime=\"2025-11-23\">Sunday 23 November 2025</time>\n            </li>\n\n            <li class=\"eventlist-meta-item eventlist-meta-time event-meta-item\">\n              <span class=\"event-time-12hr\">\n                <time class=\"event-time-12hr-start\" datetime=\"2025-11-23\">1:45 pm</time>\n                <span class=\"event-datetime-divider\"></span>\n                <time class=\"event-time-12hr-end\" datetime=\"2025-11-23\">4:00 pm</time>\n              </span>\n              <span class=\"event-time-24hr\">\n                <time class=\"event-time-24hr-start\" datetime=\"2025-11-23\">13:45</time>\n                <span class=\"event-datetime-divider\"></span>\n                <time class=\"event-time-12hr-end\" datetime=\"2025-11-23\">16:00</time>\n              </span>\n            </li>\n\n            \n\n            \n              \n            \n\n            <li class=\"eventlist-meta-item eventlist-meta-export event-meta-item\">\n              <a href=\"http://www.google.com/calendar/event?action=TEMPLATE&text=Native%20Spirit%20Festival%2