n              <a href=\"http://www.google.com/calendar/event?action=TEMPLATE&text=Home%20Cinema%3A%20experimental%20shorts%20%2B%20Poetry%20reading%20%2B%20The%20Lacey%20Rituals%20&dates=20251119T183000Z/20251119T213000Z\" class=\"eventlist-meta-export-google\">Google Calendar</a>\n              <span class=\"eventlist-meta-export-divider\"></span>\n              <a href=\"/events/home-cinema-2?format=ical\" class=\"eventlist-meta-export-ical\">ICS</a>\n            </li>\n\n          </ul>\n\n          \n          <div class=\"eventlist-excerpt\"><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">A screening of <em>Living Inside</em>, <em>Underscan</em> and <em>Window Work</em>, a poetry reading by <strong>Bidhya Limbu</strong>, followed by <em>The Lacey Rituals</em>, as part of <em>Home Cinema</em><strong><em>, </em></strong>a curated season of films dedicated to the people, the artefacts and the memories that magic a space into a home.</p></div>\n          \n\n          <a href=\"/events/home-cinema-2\" class=\"eventlist-button sqs-editable-button sqs-button-element--primary\">\n            View Event &#8594;\n          </a>\n\n          <div class=\"eventlist-actions\">\n  <span class=\"sqs-simple-like\" data-item-id=\"68e64a1640ece40b2811095f\" data-like-count=\"0\">\n    <span class=\"like-icon\"></span>\n    <span class=\"like-count\"></span>\n  </span>\n<span class=\"squarespace-social-buttons inline-style\" data-system-data-id=\"1759923341784-USGT40Y5YKGSPXIPF1PG\" data-asset-url=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5a65df9e2aeba5d8b0fd547c/1759923341784-USGT40Y5YKGSPXIPF1PG/Day+2.png\" data-record-type=\"12\" data-full-url=\"/events/home-cinema-2\" data-title=\"Home Cinema: experimental shorts + Poetry reading + The Lacey Rituals \"></span></div>\n\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"clear\"></div>\n\n      </article>\n\n    \n\n      <article class=\"eventlist-event eventlist-event--past eventlist-event--hasimg eventlist-ha