        </li>\n\n          </ul>\n\n          \n          <div class=\"eventlist-excerpt\"><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">A series of films presented by <strong>Animal Nature Future Film Festival</strong>,  screening <em>The Inflammation of Nature</em> (2025), <em>Watchful</em> (2025) &amp; <em>Never too Late</em> (2025)</p></div>\n          \n\n          <a href=\"/events/animal-nature-future-film\" class=\"eventlist-button sqs-editable-button sqs-button-element--primary\">\n            View Event &#8594;\n          </a>\n\n          <div class=\"eventlist-actions\">\n  <span class=\"sqs-simple-like\" data-item-id=\"68cd69fc82da3a49c6910c55\" data-like-count=\"0\">\n    <span class=\"like-icon\"></span>\n    <span class=\"like-count\"></span>\n  </span>\n<span class=\"squarespace-social-buttons inline-style\" data-system-data-id=\"1758561844232-UFQBHXMSPUG2C4LQ6XVC\" data-asset-url=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5a65df9e2aeba5d8b0fd547c/1758561844232-UFQBHXMSPUG2C4LQ6XVC/%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B5%B7%E6%8A%A5%2BEN.webp\" data-record-type=\"12\" data-full-url=\"/events/animal-nature-future-film\" data-title=\"Animal Nature Future Film Festival 2025\"></span></div>\n\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"clear\"></div>\n\n      </article>\n\n    \n\n      <article class=\"eventlist-event eventlist-event--past eventlist-event--hasimg eventlist-hasimg\">\n\n        <a href=\"/events/miskatonic-mindthedoors\" class=\"eventlist-column-thumbnail content-fill\"><img data-src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5a65df9e2aeba5d8b0fd547c/1758280211179-W4NQ8BN2D5OIXS6BGC0J/LND+-+2-+IG.png\" data-image=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5a65df9e2aeba5d8b0fd547c/1758280211179-W4NQ8BN2D5OIXS6BGC0J/LND+-+2-+IG.png\" data-image-dimensions=\"2250x2813\" data-image-focal-point=\"0.5,0.5\" alt=\"Mind The Doors: Excavating Horror and Folklore on the London Underground\"  class=\"eventlist-thumbnail\" data-lo