/time>\n                <span class=\"event-datetime-divider\"></span>\n                <time class=\"event-time-12hr-end\" datetime=\"2025-10-14\">22:30</time>\n              </span>\n            </li>\n\n            \n\n            \n              \n            \n\n            <li class=\"eventlist-meta-item eventlist-meta-export event-meta-item\">\n              <a href=\"http://www.google.com/calendar/event?action=TEMPLATE&text=Mind%20The%20Doors%3A%20Excavating%20Horror%20and%20Folklore%20on%20the%20London%20Underground&dates=20251014T180000Z/20251014T213000Z\" class=\"eventlist-meta-export-google\">Google Calendar</a>\n              <span class=\"eventlist-meta-export-divider\"></span>\n              <a href=\"/events/miskatonic-mindthedoors?format=ical\" class=\"eventlist-meta-export-ical\">ICS</a>\n            </li>\n\n          </ul>\n\n          \n          <div class=\"eventlist-excerpt\"><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><strong>Antony Clayton</strong> joins the <strong>Miskatonic Institute of Horror Studies</strong> to explore a century of horror cinema rooted in the underworlds of fact and folklore, where everyday transit systems become uncanny landscapes of dread. We will trace how myth and rumour entwine with the anxieties of the modern city, shaping films that turn tunnels into sites of fear, claustrophobia, and monstrous intrusion.</p></div>\n          \n\n          <a href=\"/events/miskatonic-mindthedoors\" class=\"eventlist-button sqs-editable-button sqs-button-element--primary\">\n            View Event &#8594;\n          </a>\n\n          <div class=\"eventlist-actions\">\n  <span class=\"sqs-simple-like\" data-item-id=\"68cd396dc115c30085a7bd3c\" data-like-count=\"0\">\n    <span class=\"like-icon\"></span>\n    <span class=\"like-count\"></span>\n  </span>\n<span class=\"squarespace-social-buttons inline-style\" data-system-data-id=\"1758280211179-W4NQ8BN2D5OIXS6BGC0J\" data-asset-url=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5a65df9e2aeba5d8b0fd547c/1758280211179-W4NQ8BN2D5OIXS6BGC0J/LND+-+2-+IG.png\" data-record-type=\"12\" data-full-url=\"/events/miskatonic-mindthedoors\" data-title=\"Mind The Doors: Excavating Horror and Folklore on the London Underground\"></span></div>\n\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"clear\"></div>\n\n      </article>\n\n    \n\n      <article class=\"eventlist-event eventlist-event--past eventlist-event--hasimg eventlist-hasimg\">\n\n        <a href=\"/events/becoming-stases-static-stagnant\" class=\"eventlist-column-thumbnail content-fill\"><img data-src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5a65df9e2aeba5d8b0fd547c/1758625829800-Q7O32N17HEBJWA6POLP9/HR_LANDSCAPE.png\" data-image=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5a65df9e2aeba5d8b0fd547c/1758625829800-Q7O32N17HEBJWA6POLP9/HR_LANDSCAPE.png\" data-image-dimensions=\"5401x4001\" data-image-focal-point=\"0.5,0.5\" alt=\"becoming stases static stagnant\"  class=\"eventlist-thumbnail\" data-load=\"false\"></a>\n\n        <a href=\"/events/becoming-stases-static-stagnant\" class=\"eventlist-column-date\">\n\n          <div class=\"eventlist-datetag\">\n\n            <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-inner\">\n\n              <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-startdate eventlist-datetag-startdate--month\">Oct</div>\n              <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-startdate eventlist-datetag-startdate--day\">10</div>\n\n              \n              <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-time\"><span class=\"event-time-12hr\">7:00 pm</span><span class=\"event-time-24hr\">19:00</span></div>\n\n              \n\n              <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-status\"></div>\n\n            </div>\n\n          </div>\n\n        </a>\n\n        <div class=\"eventlist-column-info\">\n\n          \n          <div class=\"eventlist-cats\">\n            <a href=\"?category=Upcoming\">Upcoming</a>, <a href=\"?category=Performance\">Performance</a>, <a href=\"?category=Exhibition\">Exhibition<