-excerpt\"><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><strong>Genesis P-Orridge</strong> lived their art to the extreme. A pioneering musician, avant-garde artist, spiritual explorer and gender revolutionary, Genesis has been featured in films and videos, but never the full story… never this intimate... until now. With a panel discussion featuring <strong>Chadd Curry</strong> aka <strong>Dahc Dermur VIII</strong>.</p></div>\n          \n\n          <a href=\"/events/s/he-is-still-her/e\" class=\"eventlist-button sqs-editable-button sqs-button-element--primary\">\n            View Event &#8594;\n          </a>\n\n          <div class=\"eventlist-actions\">\n  <span class=\"sqs-simple-like\" data-item-id=\"6863c541e083ae1cb2e15a12\" data-like-count=\"0\">\n    <span class=\"like-icon\"></span>\n    <span class=\"like-count\"></span>\n  </span>\n<span class=\"squarespace-social-buttons inline-style\" data-system-data-id=\"1751369357422-5OA03D87E2FS5QJOS9N7\" data-asset-url=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5a65df9e2aeba5d8b0fd547c/1751369357422-5OA03D87E2FS5QJOS9N7/CIN_SheIsStillHereDoc_1600x900+%281%29.jpg\" data-record-type=\"12\" data-full-url=\"/events/s/he-is-still-her/e\" data-title=\"S/He Is Still Her/e - The Official Genesis P-Orridge Documentary &amp;amp; Panel Discussion\"></span></div>\n\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"clear\"></div>\n\n      </article>\n\n    \n\n      <article class=\"eventlist-event eventlist-event--past eventlist-event--hasimg eventlist-hasimg\">\n\n        <a href=\"/events/songs-ii\" class=\"eventlist-column-thumbnail content-fill\"><img data-src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5a65df9e2aeba5d8b0fd547c/1751359634685-046DZM2TZRW4Z9ZAGMP5/image0.jpg\" data-image=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5a65df9e2aeba5d8b0fd547c/1751359634685-046DZM2TZRW4Z9ZAGMP5/image0.jpg\" data-image-dimensions=\"2500x1875\" data-image-focal-point=\"0.5,0.5\" alt=\"Songs ii: A Dirge F