ical\" class=\"eventlist-meta-export-ical\">ICS</a>\n            </li>\n\n          </ul>\n\n          \n          <div class=\"eventlist-excerpt\"><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Three sets exploring the friction between electronics, physical media, and acoustic performance. Performances from<strong> Laura Phillips</strong>, <strong>Joe Bates </strong>&amp; <strong>Amalia Young</strong>, and <strong>Lara Agar </strong>&amp; <strong>Rosalie Warner</strong>.</p></div>\n          \n\n          <a href=\"/events/electronic-music-expanded-film\" class=\"eventlist-button sqs-editable-button sqs-button-element--primary\">\n            View Event &#8594;\n          </a>\n\n          <div class=\"eventlist-actions\">\n  <span class=\"sqs-simple-like\" data-item-id=\"67d951676fa5760f5aac46cc\" data-like-count=\"0\">\n    <span class=\"like-icon\"></span>\n    <span class=\"like-count\"></span>\n  </span>\n<span class=\"squarespace-social-buttons inline-style\" data-system-data-id=\"a924eeb7-ed7f-458f-9fc7-85edb13cbb8f\" data-asset-url=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5a65df9e2aeba5d8b0fd547c/a924eeb7-ed7f-458f-9fc7-85edb13cbb8f/Flyer+16+by+9.jpg\" data-record-type=\"12\" data-full-url=\"/events/electronic-music-expanded-film\" data-title=\"Electronic music &amp;amp; expanded film: Laura Phillips | Joe Bates &amp;amp; Amalia Young | Lara Agar &amp;amp; Rosalie Warner\"></span></div>\n\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"clear\"></div>\n\n      </article>\n\n    \n\n      <article class=\"eventlist-event eventlist-event--past eventlist-event--hasimg eventlist-hasimg\">\n\n        <a href=\"/events/sidesplitting\" class=\"eventlist-column-thumbnail content-fill\"><img data-src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5a65df9e2aeba5d8b0fd547c/1729252475778-AEM5RG9U6J23NDHOEAU2/Sidesplitting-HAH.jpg\" data-image=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5a65df9e2aeba5d8b0fd547c/1729252475778-AEM5RG9U6J23NDHOEAU2/Sidesplitting-HAH.jpg\" data-image-dimensions=\"782x587\" data-image-focal-point=\"0.5,0.5\" alt=\"POSTPONED - DATE TBC Side-Splitting introduced by William English\"  class=\"eventlist-thumbnail\" data-load=\"false\"></a>\n\n        <a href=\"/events/sidesplitting\" class=\"eventlist-column-date\">\n\n          <div class=\"eventlist-datetag\">\n\n            <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-inner\">\n\n              <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-startdate eventlist-datetag-startdate--month\">Nov</div>\n              <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-startdate eventlist-datetag-startdate--day\">21</div>\n\n              \n              <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-time\"><span class=\"event-time-12hr\">7:00 pm</span><span class=\"event-time-24hr\">19:00</span></div>\n\n              \n\n              <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-status\"></div>\n\n            </div>\n\n          </div>\n\n        </a>\n\n        <div class=\"eventlist-column-info\">\n\n          \n          <div class=\"eventlist-cats\">\n            <a href=\"?category=Upcoming\">Upcoming</a>, <a href=\"?category=Film\">Film</a>\n          </div>\n          \n\n          <h1 class=\"eventlist-title\"><a href=\"/events/sidesplitting\" class=\"eventlist-title-link\">POSTPONED - DATE TBC Side-Splitting introduced by William English</a></h1>\n\n          <ul class=\"eventlist-meta event-meta\">\n\n            \n\n            <li class=\"eventlist-meta-item eventlist-meta-date event-meta-item\">\n              <time class=\"event-date\" datetime=\"2024-11-21\">Thursday 21 November 2024</time>\n            </li>\n\n            <li class=\"eventlist-meta-item eventlist-meta-time event-meta-item\">\n              <span class=\"event-time-12hr\">\n                <time class=\"event-time-12hr-start\" datetime=\"2024-11-21\">7:00 pm</time>\n                <span class=\"event-datetime-divider\"></span>\n                <time class=\"event-time-12hr-end\" datetime=\"2024-11-21\">10:00 pm</time>\n              </span>\n              <span class=\"event-time-24hr\">\n                <time class=\"event-time-24hr-start\" datetime=\"2024-11-21\">19:00</time>\n                <span class=\"event-datetime-divider\"></span>\n                <time class=\"event-time-12hr-end\" datetime=\"2024-11-21\">22:00</time>\n              </span>\n            </li>\n\n            \n\n            \n              \n            \n\n            <li class=\"eventlist-meta-item eventlist-meta-export event-meta-item\">\n              <a href=\"http://www.google.com/calendar/event?action=TEMPLATE&text=POSTPONED%20-%20DATE%20TBC%20Side-Splitting%20introduced%20by%20William%20English&dates=20241121T190000Z/20241121T220000Z\" class=\"eventlist-meta-export-google\">Google Calendar</a>\n              <span class=\"eventlist-meta-export-divider\"></span>\n              <a href=\"/events/sidesplitting?format=ical\" class=\"eventlist-meta-export-ical\">ICS</a>\n            </li>\n\n          </ul>\n\n          \n          <div class=\"eventlist-excerpt\"><p class=\"sqsrte-small\"><strong>Side-Splitting</strong> : ironic humour, sometimes wry, bordering on the sardonic, with distressed clowns, derelict funfairs and smoking promoted as pleasure with dire consequences. An off-piste revue curated by&nbsp; <strong>William English</strong> &nbsp;accompanied by a post-A.I. narcissistic clown/photographer.</p></div>\n          \n\n          <a href=\"/events/sidesplitting\" class=\"eventlist-button sqs-editable-button sqs-button-element--primary\">\n            View Event &#8594;\n          </a>\n\n          <div class=\"eventlist-actions\">\n  <span class=\"sqs-simple-like\" data-item-id=\"67124b90a39c387342fbc933\" data-like-count=\"0\">\n    <span class=\"like-icon\"></span>\n    <span class=\"like-count\"></span>\n  </span>\n<span class=\"squarespace-social-buttons inline-style\" data-system-data-id=\"1729252475778-AEM5RG9U6J23NDHOEAU2\" data-asset-url=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5a65df9e2aeba5d8b0fd547c/1729252475778-AEM5RG9U6J23NDHOEAU2/Sidesplitting-HAH.jpg\" data-record-type=\"12\" data-full-url=\"/events/sidesplitting\" data-title=\"POSTPONED - DATE TBC Side-Splitting introduced by William English\"></span></div>\n\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"clear\"></div>\n\n      </article>\n\n    \n\n      <article class=\"eventlist-event eventlist-event--past eventlist-event--hasimg eventlist-hasimg\">\n\n        <a href=\"/events/artistsdepressionanxietyandrage\" class=\"eventlist-column-thumbnail content-fill\"><img data-src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5a65df9e2aeba5d8b0fd547c/1728576801188-GJT4IF9MQT8D88THFQLQ/DAR+poster+1.jpg\" data-image=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5a65df9e2aeba5d8b0fd547c/1728576801188-GJT4IF9MQT8D88THFQLQ/DAR+poster+1.jpg\" data-image-dimensions=\"4056x4200\" data-image-focal-point=\"0.5,0.5\" alt=\"'Artists: Depression, Anxiety &amp;amp; Rage' directed by Lydia Lunch and Jasmine Hirst\"  class=\"eventlist-thumbnail\" data-load=\"false\"></a>\n\n        <a href=\"/events/artistsdepressionanxietyandrage\" class=\"eventlist-column-date\">\n\n          <div class=\"eventlist-datetag\">\n\n            <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-inner\">\n\n              <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-startdate eventlist-datetag-startdate--month\">Nov</div>\n              <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-startdate eventlist-datetag-startdate--day\">19</div>\n\n              \n              <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-time\"><span class=\"event-time-12hr\">7:00 pm</span><span class=\"event-time-24hr\">19:00</span></div>\n\n              \n\n              <div class=\"eventlist-datetag-status\"></div>\n\n            </div>\n\n          </div>\n\n        </a>\n\n        <div class=\"eventlist-column-info\">\n\n          \n          <div class=\"eventlist-cats\">\n            <a href=\"?category=Upcoming\">Upcoming</a>, <a href=\"?category=Film\">Film</a>\n          </div>\n          \n\n          <h1 class=\"eventlist-title\"><a href=\"/events/artistsdepressionanxietyandrage\" class=\"eventlist-title-link\">'Artists: Depression, Anxiety &amp; Rage' directed by Lydia Lunch and Jasmine Hirst</a></h1>\n\n          <ul class=\"eventlist-meta event-meta\">\n\n            \n\n            <li class=\"eventlist-meta-item eventlist-meta-date event-meta-item\">\n              <time class=\"event-date\" datetime=\"2024-11-19\">Tuesday 19 November 2024</time>\n            </li>\n\n            <li class=\"eventlist-meta-item eventlist-meta-time event-meta-item\">\n              <span class=\"event-time-12hr\">\n                <time class=\"event-time-12hr-start\" datetime=\"2024-11-19\">7:00 pm</time>\n                <span class=\"event-datetime-divider\"></span>\n                <time class=\"event-time-12hr-end\" datetime=\"2024-11-19\">10:00 pm</time>\n              </span>\n              <span class=\"event-time-24hr\">\n                <time class=\"event-time-24hr-start\" datetime=\"2024-11-19\">19:00</time>\n                <span class=\"event-datetime-divider\"></span>\n                <time class=\"event-time-12hr-end\" datetime=\"2024-11-19\">22:00</time>\n              </span>\n            </li>\n\n            \n\n            \n              \n            \n\n            <li class=\"eventlist-meta-item eventlist-meta-export event-meta-item\">\n              <a href=\"http://www.google.com/calendar/event?action=TEMPLATE&text=%27Artists%3A%20Depression%2C%20Anxiety%20%26amp%3B%20Rage%27%20directed%20by%20Lydia%20Lunch%20and%20Jasmine%20Hirst&dates=20241119T190000Z/20241119T220000Z\" class=\"eventlist-meta-export-google\">Google Calendar</a>\n              <span class=\"eventlist-meta-export-divider\"></span>\n              <a href=\"/events/artistsdepressionanxietyandrage?format=ical\" class=\"eventlist-meta-export-ical\">ICS</a>\n            </li>\n\n          </ul>\n\n          \n          <div class=\"eventlist-excerpt\"><p class=\"sqsrte-small\"><strong><em>Artists - Depression, Anxiety, and Rage</em></strong> is a timely expression of faith that through art, community, and an open dialogue about our darkest experiences, not only can we heal, but our loved ones may come to a better understanding of the struggles so many of us have endured. Screening followed by a Q&amp;A with <strong>Jasmine Hirst</strong></p></div>\n          \n\n          <a href=\"/events/artistsdepressionanxietyandrage\" class=\"eventlist-button sqs-editable-button sqs-button-element--primary\">\n            View Event &#8594;\n          </a>\n\n          <div class=\"eventlist-actions\">\n  <span class=\"sqs-simple-like\" data-item-id=\"6707fc3da878b56cb6eddb54\" data-like-count=\"0\">\n    <span class=\"like-icon\"></span>\n    <span class=\"like-count\"></span>\n  </span>\n<span class=\"squarespace-social-buttons inline-style\" data-system-data-id=\"1728576801188-GJT4IF9MQT8D88THFQLQ\" data-asset-url=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5a65df9e2aeba5d8b0fd547c/1728576801188-GJT4IF9MQT8D88THFQLQ/DAR+poster+1.jpg\" data-record-type=\"12\" data-full-url=\"/events/artistsdepressionanxietyandrage\" data-title=\"'Artists: Depression, Anxiety &amp;amp; Rage' directed by Lydia Lunch and Jasmine Hirst\"></span></div>\n\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"clear\"></div>\n\n      </article>\n\n    \n\n      <article class=\"eventlist-event eventlist-event--past eventlist-event--hasimg eventlist-hasimg\">\n\n        <a href=\"/events/gettingcarter\" class=\"eventlist-column-thumbnail content-fill\"><img data-src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5a65df9e2aeba5d8b0fd547c/1729254775520-TCHJFANRWXHJAUF49BNV/Last-days-promo-sans.jpg\" data-image=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5a65df9e2aeba5d8b0fd547c/1729254775520-TCHJFANRWXHJAUF49BNV/Last-days-promo-sans.jpg\" data-image-dimensions=\"1499x1499\" data-image-focal-point=\"0.5,0.5\" alt=\"GETTING CARTER and THE LAST DAYS OF JOHNNY NUNN \"  class=\"eventlist-thumbnail\