       \n      \n        </figure>\n      \n\n    </div>\n  \n\n\n  \n\n\n</div></div><div class=\"sqs-block horizontalrule-block sqs-block-horizontalrule\" data-block-type=\"47\" id=\"block-yui_3_17_2_1_1767696670151_117966\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><hr /></div></div><div class=\"sqs-block html-block sqs-block-html\" data-block-type=\"2\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" id=\"block-yui_3_17_2_1_1767696670151_120004\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n<div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content>\n  <p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>TS2: Terror to Skull </strong></p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n</div></div><div class=\"sqs-block image-block sqs-block-image\" data-block-type=\"5\" id=\"block-yui_3_17_2_1_1767696670151_120413\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n    \n  \n    <div\n        class=\"\n          image-block-outer-wrapper\n          layout-caption-below\n          design-layout-inline\n          combination-animation-none\n          individual-animation-none\n          individual-text-animation-none\n        \"\n        data-test=\"image-block-inline-outer-wrapper\"\n    >\n\n      \n\n      \n        <figure\n            class=\"\n              sqs-block-image-figure\n              intrinsic\n            \"\n            style=\"max-width:3023px;\"\n        >\n          \n        \n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n          <div\n              \n              \n              class=\"image-block-wrapper\"\n              data-animation-role=\"image\"\n              \n  \n\n          >\n            <div class=\"sqs-image-shape-container-element\n              \n          \n        \n              has-aspect-ratio\n            \" style=\"\n                position: relative;\n                \n                  padding-bottom:56.136287689208984%;\n                \n                overflow: hidden;-webkit-mask-image: -webkit-radial-gradient(white, black);\n              \"\n              >\n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                <img data-stretch=\"false\" data-src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5a65df9e2aeba5d8b0fd547c/9ffceac6-a84d-4f61-89ad-6dc14128d73c/Screenshot+2026-01-06+at+10.59.25.png\" data-image=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5a65df9e2aeba5d8b0fd547c/9ffceac6-a84d-4f61-89ad-6dc14128d73c/Screenshot+2026-01-06+at+10.59.25.png\" data-image-dimensions=\"3023x1697\" data-image-focal-point=\"0.5,0.5\" alt=\"\" data-load=\"false\" elementtiming=\"system-image-block\"  src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5a65df9e2aeba5d8b0fd547c/9ffceac6-a84d-4f61-89ad-6dc14128d73c/Screenshot+2026-01-06+at+10.59.25.png\" width=\"3023\" height=\"1697\" alt=\"\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 767px) 100vw, 100vw\" style=\"display:block;object-fit: cover; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-position: 50% 50%\" onload=\"this.classList.add(&quot;loaded&quot;)\" srcset=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5a65df9e2aeba5d8b0fd547c/9ffceac6-a84d-4f61-89ad-6dc14128d73c/Screenshot+2026-01-06+at+10.59.25.png?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5a65df9e2aeba5d8b0fd547c/9ffceac6-a84d-4f61-89ad-6dc14128d73c/Screenshot+2026-01-06+at+10.59.25.png?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5a65df9e2aeba5d8b0fd547c/9ffceac6-a84d-4f61-89ad-6dc14128d73c/Screenshot+2026-01-06+at+10.59.25.png?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5a65df9e2aeba5d8b0fd547c/9ffceac6-a84d-4f61-89ad-6dc14128d73c/Screenshot+2026-01-06+at+10.59.25.png?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5a65df9e2aeba5d8b0fd547c/9ffceac6-a84d-4f61-89ad-6dc14128d73c/Screenshot+2026-01-06+at+10.59.25.png?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5a65df9e2aeba5d8b0fd547c/9ffceac6-a84d-4f61-89ad-6dc14128d73c/Screenshot+2026-01-06+at+10.59.25.png?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5a65df9e2aeba5d8b0fd547c/9ffceac6-a84d-4f61-89ad-6dc14128d73c/Screenshot+2026-01-06+at+10.59.25.png?format=2500w 2500w\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-loader=\"sqs\">\n\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        \n          \n        \n\n        \n      \n        </figure>\n      \n\n    </div>\n  \n\n\n  \n\n\n</div></div><div class=\"sqs-block html-block sqs-block-html\" data-block-type=\"2\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" id=\"block-yui_3_17_2_1_1767696670151_118238\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n<div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content>\n  <blockquote><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Let us state our aim clearly: the final objective of these new psyops and sonic weapons is to create artifacts, devices, audio phenomena and events able to reach the listeners exploiting the routes of voluntary and involuntary military circulation - signal transmission, intermission, reception, de/codification, encryption/decryption, interception and hijacking - where listening triggers auditory paranoia via deception, disruption, and sensory stress techniques. The objective is to produce asemic impulses which through timbral manipulation and framing are transformed by the listener’s purposeful or accidental listening into harmful sonic experiences through the automatism of the subject’s autogenous speculative significations. This class of weapons follows the principle that, classically, warfare is conceived as conflict against an “other” that is constantly imagined and re-imagined as a dangerous exotic presence. Therefore, playing with this imagination and making it at the same time concrete and vague is a weapon in itself to be harnessed. </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">-  Analyst A-113, Signal Warfare Research Unit</p></blockquote>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n</div></div><div class=\"sqs-block horizontalrule-block sqs-block-horizontalrule\" data-block-type=\"47\" id=\"block-981f147ca52887660c39\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><hr /></div></div><div class=\"sqs-block html-block sqs-block-html\" data-block-type=\"2\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" id=\"block-5f2001e65830148c829f\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n<div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content>\n  <p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p><h1 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">RELATED EVENTS</h1>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n</div></div></div></div></div>\n\n      \n      <div class=\"eventitem-content-footer\">\n\n        \n\n        \n          <ul class=\"eventitem-meta event-meta event-meta-cats-tags-container\">\n            <li class=\"eventitem-meta-item eventitem-meta-cats event-meta-item\">Posted in <a href=\"/events?category=Upcoming\">Upcoming</a>, <a href=\"/events?category=Film\">Film</a></li>\n            \n          </ul>\n        \n\n        <div class=\"eventitem-meta event-meta event-meta-socialicon-container\">\n  <span class=\"sqs-simple-like\" data-item-id=\"695ce929fb73ba4f27c2ee8d\" data-like-count=\"0\">\n    <span class=\"like-icon\"></span>\n    <span class=\"like-count\"></span>\n  </span>\n<span class=\"squarespace-social-buttons inline-style\" data-system-data-id=\"c3671d9d-a52c-412b-a3df-1dfffdb1738d\" data-asset-url=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5a65df9e2aeba5d8b0fd547c/c3671d9d-a52c-412b-a3df-1dfffdb1738d/Screenshot+2026-01-07+at+11.03.15.png\" data-record-type=\"12\" data-full-url=\"/events/tribulation-99\" data-title=\"Tribulation 99 | Tellurian Drama | TS2\"></span></div>\n      </div>\n      \n\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"clear\"></div>\n\n  </article>\n\n  \n\n  <div class=\"clear\"></div>\n\n\n  \n    \n    <div class=\"eventitem-pager\">\n\n    